  "question": "For any $2 \\times 2$ matrix $A$, if $A(adj A) = \\begin{bmatrix} 10 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 10 \\end{bmatrix}$, then $|A| = ?$",
  "answeroption": "B",
  "explanation": "We know that $A(adj A) = |A|I$<br /><br />Given: $A(adj A) = \\begin{bmatrix} 10 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 10 \\end{bmatrix} = 10I$<br /><br />Therefore: $|A|I = 10I$<br /><br />So: $|A| = 10$",
